TI  - Heart rate variability and nonlinear analysis of heart rate dynamics following single and multiple Wingate bouts
T2  - APPLIED PHYSIOLOGY NUTRITION AND METABOLISM
LA  - English
KW  - interval training
KW  - Wingate
KW  - nonlinear
KW  - heart rate variability
