TI  - Automated adaptive detection and reconstruction of quiescent cardiac phases in free-running whole-heart acquisitions using Synchronicity Maps from PHysiological mOtioN In Cine (SYMPHONIC) MRI
T2  - MAGNETIC RESONANCE MATERIALS IN PHYSICS BIOLOGY AND MEDICINE
LA  - English
