TI  - Summated Hazard Score as a Powerful Predictor of Fatigue in Relation to Pacing Strategy
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH AND PUBLIC HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - pacing
KW  - cycling
KW  - time trial
KW  - RPE
