TI  - The effect of sorbet containing the Australian native plant Davidson plum (Davidsonia jerseyana) on muscle recovery following a high-intensity interval training session in long-distance runners - A protocol for a double-blind parallel trial
T2  - NUTRITION AND HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Human nutrition
KW  - functional foods
KW  - polyphenols
