TI  - The effect of concurrent high-intensity interval training and resistance training on the lower body maximal strength and explosive power: A updated systematic review and meta-analysis
T2  - ISOKINETICS AND EXERCISE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Concurrent training
KW  - HIIT
