TI  - COMBINING DIFFERENT CONCURRENT TRAINING METHODS IN OLDER ADULTS WITH METABOLIC SYNDROME
T2  - REVISTA BRASILEIRA DE MEDICINA DO ESPORTE
LA  - English
KW  - High-intensity interval training
KW  - Resistance training
KW  - Endurance training
