TI  - A Model for the Training Effects in Swimming Demonstrates a Strong Relationship between Parasympathetic Activity, Performance and Index of Fatigue
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
KW  - SYSTEMS-MODEL
KW  - RESPONSES
