TI  - Cashew apple juice supplementation enhances leukocyte count by reducing oxidative stress after high-intensity exercise in trained and untrained men
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE INTERNATIONAL SOCIETY OF SPORTS NUTRITION
LA  - English
