TI  - Validity and agreement of the 30-15 Intermittent Fitness Test for estimating aerobic and performance-related parameters: a systematic review and meta-analysis
T2  - BMC SPORTS SCIENCE MEDICINE AND REHABILITATION
LA  - English
KW  - Aerobic capacity
KW  - Validity
KW  - Aerobic capacity
KW  - Cardiorespiratoryfitness
