TI  - Eight Weeks of Supervised Pulmonary Rehabilitation Are Effective in Improving Resting Heart Rate and Heart Rate Recovery in Severe COVID-19 Patient Survivors of Mechanical Ventilation
T2  - MEDICINA-LITHUANIA
LA  - English
KW  - heart rate
