TI  - Multimodal approach towards understanding the changes in the autonomic nervous system induced by an ultramarathon
T2  - RESEARCH IN SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - Autonomic network
KW  - canonical correlation analysis
KW  - heart rate
