TI  - Stage duration and increase of work load in incremental testing on a cycle ergometer
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF APPLIED PHYSIOLOGY AND OCCUPATIONAL PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - anaerobic threshold
KW  - lactate steady-state
KW  - incremental testing
