TI  - Randomised controlled pilot and feasibility study of multimodal agility-based exercise training (MAT) versus strength and endurance training (SET) to improve multiple sclerosis-related fatigue and fatigability during inpatient rehabilitation (ReFEx): study protocol
T2  - BMJ OPEN
LA  - English
KW  - Multiple sclerosis
KW  - SPORTS MEDICINE
KW  - REHABILITATION MEDICINE
