TI  - Leptin as a marker of training stress in highly trained male rowers?
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF APPLIED PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - athletes
KW  - body composition
KW  - heavy training
KW  - hormone responses
