TI  - Hot- and Cold-Water Immersion Do Not Alter Performance or Perceived Fatigability but Improve Muscle Activation, Cardiac Vagal Modulation, and Cardiorespiratory Recovery After Distinct Running Protocols
T2  - SCANDINAVIAN JOURNAL OF MEDICINE & SCIENCE IN SPORTS
