TI  - Revisiting the evidence on caffeine mouth rinse: effects on exercise and cognitive performance: a meta-analytic review
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE INTERNATIONAL SOCIETY OF SPORTS NUTRITION
LA  - English
KW  - Caffeine mouth rinsing
KW  - exercise performance
KW  - cognitive performance
KW  - meta-analysis
