TI  - Seasonal variations in body composition, maximal oxygen uptake, and gas exchange threshold in cross-country skiers
T2  - OPEN ACCESS JOURNAL OF SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - athletic performance
KW  - aerobic capacity
KW  - winter sport
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
