TI  - HUMAN GASTRIN AND VASOACTIVE INTESTINAL POLYPEPTIDE RESPONSES TO ENDURANCE RUNNING IN RELATION TO TRAINING STATUS AND FLUID INGESTED
T2  - CLINICAL SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - GASTRIN
KW  - MALTODEXTRIN
