TI  - Relationships between oxygen uptake, dynamic body acceleration and heart rate in humans
T2  - JOURNAL OF SPORTS MEDICINE AND PHYSICAL FITNESS
LA  - English
KW  - Acceleration
KW  - Oxygen
KW  - Autonomic nervous system
